OL,3,AFour arrested over boxing champion's
OL,4,Amurder in South Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested in South
OL,7,FAfrica in connection with the murder of
OL,8,Fboxing champion Zolani Tete, who was
OL,9,Fshot dead outside his home on Friday.
OL,11,FTete, 38, was gunned down in what has
OL,12,Fbeen described as an ambush in
OL,13,FMdantsane, Eastern Cape. A young woman
OL,14,Fwho was with him was also shot and is
OL,15,Fin hospital.
OL,17,FOne of the men being held, a
OL,18,F22-year-old who was arrested on
OL,19,FSaturday, will make an initial
OL,20,Fappearance in court on Monday, and
OL,21,Ffaces murder and attempted murder
OL,22,Fcharges.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
