OL,3,AFour arrested over boxing champion's
OL,4,Amurder in South Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FTete held the WBO bantamweight title
OL,7,Ffrom 2017 to 2019, as well as the IBF
OL,8,Fsuper-flyweight title in 2014. He was
OL,9,Flater given a four-year ban, which
OL,10,Flapsed in July this year.
